d\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(17年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"320\" height=\"10.700000000000003\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,93.3 9.1,97.2 14.2,95.3 19.3,93.2 24.5,90.9 29.6,84.3 34.7,82.2 39.8,82.6 44.9,77.5 50.0,71.9 55.1,73.0 60.3,80.9 65.4,78.4 70.5,70.6 75.6,65.6 80.7,53.8 85.8,60.0 91.0,60.0 96.1,65.2 101.2,70.7 106.3,73.1 111.4,68.8 116.5,62.0 121.6,64.8 126.8,64.7 131.9,66.4 137.0,71.4 142.1,68.6 147.2,65.6 152.3,48.6 157.4,42.8 162.6,43.4 167.7,48.1 172.8,43.0 177.9,33.3 183.0,25.8 188.1,36.2 193.2,30.5 198.4,19.6 203.5,21.2 208.6,24.0 213.7,16.2 218.8,12.8 223.9,18.9 229.0,23.6 234.2,22.8 239.3,29.4 244.4,26.2 249.5,22.9 254.6,25.5 259.7,15.1 264.9,15.3 270.0,20.0 275.1,26.3 280.2,29.8 285.3,23.6 290.4,25.3 295.5,29.4 300.7,28.3 305.8,27.8 310.9,22.4 316.0,38.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 188.1 48.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 208.6 36.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 239.3 41.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 254.6 37.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 275.1 38.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 300.7 40.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"38.3\" r=\"4\" fill=\